    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle for It All</strong> is a tactical, fast-paced FPS blending modern military combat with sci-fi chaos. Survive zombies, robots, and bandits in solo or multiplayer modes. Includes realistic gunplay, grounded movement, and co-op zombies action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skirmish</strong> \u2013 x1 Large Scale Map 12 players, high-intensity firefights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free-For-All</strong> \u2013 Every player for themselves. featuring x1 Map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team Death Match</strong> \u2013 Classic Team vs Team Deathmatch x2 Maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonus Zombies Mode</strong>\u2013 Survive against waves of the undead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gun Game</strong> \u2013\u00a0 Progress through a series of weapons with each kill x1 Map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>How Does The Movement Feel In This Game?</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A balance of modern fps and fast paced fps movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grounded Movement &amp; Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical but Fast Paced and realistic mechanics\u2014no over-the-top movement gimmicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A balance of modern firearms and sci-fi-inspired gadgets for strategic depth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Progression &amp; Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn XP and level up through a skill-based and XP-driven unlock system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new weapons, perks, and character customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully ranked modes for every game type\u2014climb the leaderboards in competitive play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Regular Updates &amp; Community-Driven Evolution</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monthly updates with new content, balance changes, and improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A continuously evolving game shaped by player feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a focus on competitive gameplay, rewarding progression, and tactical gunfights, <i>Battle for It All</i> delivers an FPS experience designed for both hardcore and casual players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to take on the fight?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle for It All</strong> is a tactical, fast-paced FPS blending modern military combat with sci-fi chaos. Survive zombies, robots, and bandits in solo or multiplayer modes. Includes realistic gunplay, grounded movement, and co-op zombies action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skirmish</strong> \u2013 x1 Large Scale Map 12 players, high-intensity firefights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free-For-All</strong> \u2013 Every player for themselves. featuring x1 Map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team Death Match</strong> \u2013 Classic Team vs Team Deathmatch x2 Maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonus Zombies Mode</strong>\u2013 Survive against waves of the undead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gun Game</strong> \u2013\u00a0 Progress through a series of weapons with each kill x1 Map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>How Does The Movement Feel In This Game?</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A balance of modern fps and fast paced fps movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grounded Movement &amp; Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical but Fast Paced and realistic mechanics\u2014no over-the-top movement gimmicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A balance of modern firearms and sci-fi-inspired gadgets for strategic depth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Progression &amp; Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn XP and level up through a skill-based and XP-driven unlock system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new weapons, perks, and character customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully ranked modes for every game type\u2014climb the leaderboards in competitive play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Regular Updates &amp; Community-Driven Evolution</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monthly updates with new content, balance changes, and improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A continuously evolving game shaped by player feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a focus on competitive gameplay, rewarding progression, and tactical gunfights, <i>Battle for It All</i> delivers an FPS experience designed for both hardcore and casual players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to take on the fight?</p>",
